1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,075
The endodermis: a band of suberin and lignin on its radial and tangential walls, forcing water through the living cells.

2
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:16,614
The pericycle is the tempting wrong answer, because it lies right next to it, but the pericycle has no such band.

